WEBVTT

00:00:21.605 --> 00:00:25.567
I've never seen a child read
a book so intently before.

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:33.492
A magic book with everything
in this world written in it?

00:00:33.492 --> 00:00:38.497
If I read that, I don't think
I'd be scared of anything.

00:00:38.497 --> 00:00:41.458
A magic book does exist.

00:00:41.458 --> 00:00:43.252
Really?

00:00:43.252 --> 00:00:47.297
That book is in a magic library.

00:00:47.297 --> 00:00:50.050
But it's not a place where just anyone can go.

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:51.802
I can go there!

00:00:51.802 --> 00:00:54.847
That depends on how you act from now on.

00:00:54.847 --> 00:00:57.432
You must be kind to others.

00:00:57.432 --> 00:01:00.102
You must truly wish for the happiness of others.

00:01:00.686 --> 00:01:03.021
I don't really get it...

00:01:03.021 --> 00:01:06.650
You will understand someday.

00:01:06.650 --> 00:01:10.028
This is a ticket to the library.

00:01:10.028 --> 00:01:12.322
You must not lose it.

00:01:21.081 --> 00:01:24.459
Books shed light unto the darkness.

00:01:24.459 --> 00:01:29.965
Darkness retreats one letter,
one line, one page at a time,

00:01:29.965 --> 00:01:33.427
and someday, everything in
the world will become clear.

00:01:33.427 --> 00:01:38.056
When that happens,
I will be completely at peace.

00:01:42.644 --> 00:01:46.023
"Kyotaro Kakei"

00:01:56.325 --> 00:01:58.368
What should I do?

00:01:58.368 --> 00:02:01.038
There are so many people...

00:02:01.038 --> 00:02:01.622
"Shiomi Happy Project"

00:02:01.622 --> 00:02:03.290
"Shiomi Happy Project"
I'm scared...

00:02:03.290 --> 00:02:05.209
"Shiomi Happy Project"
I can't get any words out...

00:02:06.376 --> 00:02:09.963
No, I decided that I would do this.

00:02:09.963 --> 00:02:13.926
I'm going to say goodbye to my
useless self that couldn't do anything!

00:02:13.926 --> 00:02:17.429
"Tsugumi Shirasaki"

00:02:17.721 --> 00:02:20.098
Go, Tsugumi!

00:02:20.098 --> 00:02:22.267
Excuse me!

00:02:22.267 --> 00:02:24.186
Please!

00:02:25.229 --> 00:02:28.690
Will you become happy with me?

00:02:28.690 --> 00:02:30.692
Please!

00:02:30.692 --> 00:02:33.070
Will you become happy with me?

00:02:33.070 --> 00:02:36.073
She's working hard bright
and early in the morning.

00:02:37.658 --> 00:02:41.912
Will you become... happy...

00:02:45.499 --> 00:02:48.919
I-I can't lose to a little thing like this!

00:02:56.343 --> 00:02:58.679
Who could it be so early in the morning?

00:03:03.475 --> 00:03:07.938
"Today, something will happen
that will change your fate."

00:03:07.938 --> 00:03:09.940
"The Shepherd."

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:11.984
The Shepherd?

00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:25.914
That girl from earlier!

00:03:25.914 --> 00:03:27.666
She's in danger!

00:03:28.333 --> 00:03:30.586
I've always had good intuition.

00:03:30.586 --> 00:03:33.213
I'd just get a sense of foreboding,

00:03:33.213 --> 00:03:36.717
but my bad premonitions
have always been correct.

00:03:40.304 --> 00:03:41.597
You have to run!

00:03:41.597 --> 00:03:43.265
What?

00:03:44.308 --> 00:03:46.226
Just get away from here!

00:03:49.521 --> 00:03:51.940
What? Um...

00:04:09.041 --> 00:04:14.546
What is this soft sensation...?

00:04:14.546 --> 00:04:17.257
That's right! This is...

00:04:17.257 --> 00:04:19.343
This is...

00:04:19.343 --> 00:04:20.511
This is...?

00:04:20.511 --> 00:04:22.221
This is...!

00:04:22.221 --> 00:04:25.182
Ah, I-I'm sorry!

00:04:38.362 --> 00:04:40.989
This makes me...

00:04:40.989 --> 00:04:42.950
...a common molester.

00:04:47.037 --> 00:04:51.333
Well anyway, I'm glad I made it in time.

00:05:02.719 --> 00:05:05.472
<i>Writing down my aspirations</i>

00:05:05.472 --> 00:05:08.225
<i>For the day when they will come true</i>

00:05:08.225 --> 00:05:13.564
<i>The time has come when</i>
<i>I want to turn to the page I marked</i>

00:05:13.564 --> 00:05:19.027
<i>Although there are things I lose</i>
<i>sight of with everything that happens</i>

00:05:19.027 --> 00:05:20.404
<i>Hey, it's all right</i>

00:05:20.404 --> 00:05:24.324
<i>The start I'm embarking on is unexpected</i>

00:05:24.324 --> 00:05:27.160
<i>The memory that you couldn't erase</i>

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:29.830
<i>Even that sad memory</i>

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:33.876
<i>I'll give it a different, happier reading</i>

00:05:33.876 --> 00:05:39.506
<i>I feel like just that will change everything</i>

00:05:39.506 --> 00:05:40.632
<i>All Right</i>

00:05:40.632 --> 00:05:43.844
<i>So come now, the way you are!</i>

00:05:43.844 --> 00:05:46.680
<i>Don't hide your weak self</i>

00:05:46.680 --> 00:05:47.681
<i>On my Sheep </i>

00:05:47.681 --> 00:05:51.351
<i>Let's meet riding on a dream</i>

00:05:51.351 --> 00:05:57.274
<i>Even just calling your name as</i>
<i>I write in this book of adventures</i>

00:05:57.274 --> 00:06:00.110
<i>I'm not lost anymore</i>

00:06:00.110 --> 00:06:03.822
<i>Let's start our journey together</i>

00:06:03.822 --> 00:06:11.580
<i>Yes... more of you and me!</i>

00:06:22.466 --> 00:06:24.843
"Episode 1: Formation of the Library Club"
At the end of the year 1873, also called...

00:06:24.843 --> 00:06:27.346
"Episode 1: Formation of the Library Club"
Hey, Kakei--

00:06:27.721 --> 00:06:29.473
"Shiomi Academy Journalism Club News"
Look at this.

00:06:30.516 --> 00:06:33.101
It was an unprecedented derailing accident.

00:06:33.101 --> 00:06:36.522
"Ikkei Takamine"

00:06:37.064 --> 00:06:40.484
In the midst of what could have been
a horrible tragedy with one false step,

00:06:40.484 --> 00:06:44.321
there was a student who
dared to act so shamelessly.

00:06:44.321 --> 00:06:48.909
Takamine, I'm sure there's an
explanation for that guy's actions.

00:06:48.909 --> 00:06:50.369
I'm sure.

00:06:50.369 --> 00:06:55.165
There's no way a certain someone
<i>I </i>know would molest someone in public.

00:06:55.165 --> 00:06:58.293
Yeah, 'cause molestation is a crime.

00:07:00.212 --> 00:07:04.258
Well, thinking about how big this school
is and how many students there are,

00:07:04.258 --> 00:07:06.927
I'm not likely to see that girl again.

00:07:07.344 --> 00:07:12.975
Well then, seat number 153,
Shirasaki? Tsugumi Shirasaki?

00:07:12.975 --> 00:07:15.602
Y-Yes.

00:07:16.687 --> 00:07:17.896
That girl!

00:07:17.896 --> 00:07:19.398
Um...

00:07:19.398 --> 00:07:24.152
It was the opinion paper on establishing...
a democratically elected parliament...

00:07:24.152 --> 00:07:27.656
I'm sorry, say that again?

00:07:27.656 --> 00:07:28.824
Um...

00:07:30.284 --> 00:07:36.498
The opinion paper... on establishing...
a democratically elected parliament...

00:07:36.498 --> 00:07:39.710
That girl's kinda sexy...

00:07:39.710 --> 00:07:40.586
You little...

00:07:40.586 --> 00:07:42.379
Excuse me.

00:07:42.379 --> 00:07:44.089
What Shirasaki has been saying is,

00:07:44.089 --> 00:07:47.384
"The opinion paper on establishing
a democratically elected parliament."

00:07:47.384 --> 00:07:50.846
"Tamamo Sakuraba"

00:07:51.054 --> 00:07:53.056
Tamamo!

00:07:54.141 --> 00:07:57.102
I didn't think she'd be my classmate...

00:07:58.020 --> 00:08:01.732
Everyone, how is your
new life at Shiomi Academy?

00:08:01.732 --> 00:08:03.233
--Are you enjoying your new life here?

00:08:03.233 --> 00:08:05.694
--With the number of students at this school,
--Are you enjoying your new life here?

00:08:05.694 --> 00:08:07.196
--there's only a 1% chance that a random student
--Especially for you new students out there,

00:08:07.196 --> 00:08:10.073
--you meet will be your classmate.
--Especially for you new students out there,

00:08:10.073 --> 00:08:11.366
--Welcome!
--I'm sure there

00:08:11.366 --> 00:08:14.328
--Welcome to the school cafeteria, Appllio!
--are many things you're confused about.

00:08:14.328 --> 00:08:15.746
"Kana Suzuki"
But I'm sure there are many more things

00:08:15.746 --> 00:08:17.456
"Kana Suzuki"
to get excited about!

00:08:17.456 --> 00:08:18.832
I'll have the set with Japanese Spanish
mackerel pickled in sweet Kyoto-style miso.

00:08:18.832 --> 00:08:20.542
Oh, are you new?

00:08:20.542 --> 00:08:21.835
Oh, yes.

00:08:21.835 --> 00:08:24.963
I may be inexperienced,
but I look forward to serving you!

00:08:24.963 --> 00:08:26.006
Looking forward to it!

00:08:26.006 --> 00:08:29.676
I'll have the fried chicken with soy sauce and--

00:08:29.676 --> 00:08:30.886
one smile.

00:08:30.886 --> 00:08:32.012
That's so old.

00:08:32.012 --> 00:08:34.806
Um, what size would you like?

00:08:34.806 --> 00:08:36.058
Large, please!

00:08:36.058 --> 00:08:37.893
Yes, sir!

00:08:37.893 --> 00:08:40.437
Woah, that's so bright!

00:08:40.437 --> 00:08:42.481
You don't have to humor him.

00:08:42.481 --> 00:08:47.486
No! I, Suzuki, gain satisfaction
from the smiles of the customers.

00:08:47.486 --> 00:08:52.366
Japanese Spanish mackerel
and fried chicken, coming right up!

00:08:54.076 --> 00:08:57.079
That's good, Suzuki! That's good!

00:08:57.704 --> 00:09:00.165
Why don't you put your
book down while you eat, at least?

00:09:01.625 --> 00:09:05.128
"Maho Mochizuki"

00:09:05.629 --> 00:09:07.422
Woah, the student council president!

00:09:07.422 --> 00:09:08.757
Mochizuki...

00:09:08.757 --> 00:09:14.179
Hello. Kakei, may I have a word with you?

00:09:14.179 --> 00:09:17.099
If it's about our previous conversation,
I believe I already declined.

00:09:17.099 --> 00:09:20.561
I don't want to waste your abilities.

00:09:20.561 --> 00:09:23.063
You've been at the top of your
year since entering this school.

00:09:23.063 --> 00:09:25.941
I'm sure you would be able to
accomplish a lot in the student council.

00:09:25.941 --> 00:09:28.694
I'm just good at taking tests.

00:09:28.694 --> 00:09:31.822
I'm not cut out to be an officer or anything.

00:09:31.822 --> 00:09:34.074
Do you dislike the student council?

00:09:34.074 --> 00:09:37.452
I just do not want to decrease
the amount of time I spend reading.

00:09:37.452 --> 00:09:41.331
I appreciate your good opinion of me, though.

00:09:42.916 --> 00:09:46.044
I see. That's unfortunate.

00:09:46.044 --> 00:09:49.923
Here's your fried chicken
and mackerel! Thanks for waiting!

00:09:49.923 --> 00:09:53.468
Oh, um, are you sharing the table?

00:09:53.468 --> 00:09:59.391
No. Thank you for your time.
I will talk to you again soon.

00:09:59.391 --> 00:10:01.602
All right.

00:10:02.769 --> 00:10:07.316
If you keep acting that nice,
she's going to get the wrong idea, you know.

00:10:07.316 --> 00:10:10.694
It keeps her hopes up.

00:10:10.694 --> 00:10:12.988
I know that.

00:10:12.988 --> 00:10:17.117
Shiomi Academy, with 650 students in one class.

00:10:17.117 --> 00:10:20.287
500 yen for the mackerel set,
500 yen for the fried chicken,

00:10:20.287 --> 00:10:22.414
and 1,000 yen for the smile
makes 2,000 yen all together.

00:10:22.414 --> 00:10:23.665
What?!

00:10:23.665 --> 00:10:26.752
This school, which boasts
a total of 50,000 students,

00:10:26.752 --> 00:10:29.296
is the best educational environment in Japan.

00:10:29.296 --> 00:10:32.466
Students should always be
striving to improve their abilities,

00:10:32.466 --> 00:10:35.594
or they should attend a different school.

00:10:35.594 --> 00:10:38.430
It's the best place in the
world for motivated students.

00:10:42.017 --> 00:10:46.313
At the same time, it's the best
place for unmotivated students, too.

00:10:46.313 --> 00:10:49.775
That's because as long as you take enough
credits, you can do whatever you want.

00:10:49.775 --> 00:10:51.151
"Today, something will happen that will
change your fate. --From the Shepherd"

00:10:51.818 --> 00:10:53.820
The Shepherd...

00:10:53.820 --> 00:10:56.907
The most famous rumor at this school.

00:10:57.282 --> 00:11:01.537
Always somewhere around
the school, but always unseen.

00:11:01.537 --> 00:11:04.540
Only appearing in front of
those earnestly working hard,

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:07.751
and granting whatever they wish...

00:11:07.751 --> 00:11:10.087
But well, it's just spam.

00:11:10.671 --> 00:11:12.756
Hey you, can I have a moment?

00:11:16.718 --> 00:11:19.054
If I remember correctly, you're in my class...

00:11:19.054 --> 00:11:22.391
Sorry its so sudden, but will you look at this?

00:11:22.599 --> 00:11:23.725
"Uncensored"

00:11:23.809 --> 00:11:26.186
What? Uncensored?!

00:11:26.186 --> 00:11:27.229
Hm?

00:11:27.229 --> 00:11:28.397
"To: Tamamo Sakuraba"
This email address is...

00:11:28.397 --> 00:11:29.606
"Regarding the girl named Tsugumi Shirasaki"
This email address is...

00:11:29.606 --> 00:11:31.441
...the Shepherd?

00:11:31.441 --> 00:11:34.570
Am I correct in thinking you
are the person in this picture?

00:11:34.570 --> 00:11:36.738
Y-Yes, that's right, but...

00:11:36.738 --> 00:11:39.074
More importantly, that email address...

00:11:39.074 --> 00:11:41.076
Allergies?

00:11:41.076 --> 00:11:44.913
I will have you apologize to her--to Shirasaki!

00:11:44.913 --> 00:11:47.583
Before that, will you allow me to explain?

00:11:47.583 --> 00:11:50.127
Oh? I'm listening.

00:11:50.127 --> 00:11:53.046
"Shiomi Academy Student Dorms
⬅ Kannazuki Dorm   ⬆ Yayoi Dorm"

00:11:53.046 --> 00:11:56.967
In other words, you have
the ability to know the future,

00:11:56.967 --> 00:12:01.054
and <i>that </i>happened when you
were trying to save Shirasaki?

00:12:01.054 --> 00:12:03.932
It's not as cool as you make it sound, though.

00:12:04.433 --> 00:12:05.309
You fool.

00:12:05.309 --> 00:12:06.226
Huh?

00:12:06.226 --> 00:12:10.439
That is way too lousy of an excuse!

00:12:11.398 --> 00:12:14.193
Ah, no wait, I'm telling you, it's true!

00:12:14.193 --> 00:12:16.236
You're a molester, and now you're
trying to explain it away? You're the worst!

00:12:16.236 --> 00:12:18.405
Enemy of women! Prepare yourself!

00:12:18.405 --> 00:12:21.992
Crap. They're serious.

00:12:22.534 --> 00:12:24.286
See ya!

00:12:25.412 --> 00:12:28.916
Running away? You coward!

00:12:29.666 --> 00:12:31.210
A molester? Seriously?

00:12:31.210 --> 00:12:33.086
Oh, you mean from this morning's web news?

00:12:33.086 --> 00:12:35.756
Yeah, yeah, a second-year guy!

00:12:35.756 --> 00:12:38.091
The one who always has his nose in a book.

00:12:38.091 --> 00:12:41.303
"Shiomi Academy Journalism Club News"
It's always the quiet ones you have to look out for!

00:12:43.180 --> 00:12:47.226
Aw man, why did it end up like this?

00:12:47.226 --> 00:12:49.645
All I did was save a girl...

00:12:49.645 --> 00:12:51.813
Where did you go?!

00:12:51.813 --> 00:12:55.484
Anyway, I have to hide somewhere
and recover my strength...

00:12:56.318 --> 00:12:57.778
Y-You're...!

00:12:57.778 --> 00:13:00.572
I-I'm sorry...

00:13:00.572 --> 00:13:02.991
It's my fault it's turned into this...

00:13:02.991 --> 00:13:05.285
W-Wait, this position is...

00:13:05.285 --> 00:13:06.745
What?

00:13:07.663 --> 00:13:11.250
If someone sees us here like this,
there'll be another misunderstanding...

00:13:11.250 --> 00:13:12.626
You bastard!

00:13:12.626 --> 00:13:15.212
Not just once, but twice?!

00:13:15.212 --> 00:13:17.339
I said, it's a misunderstanding!

00:13:17.339 --> 00:13:19.383
Th-That's not it, Tamamo! This is--

00:13:19.383 --> 00:13:21.885
Shirasaki, I'll save you now, okay?

00:13:21.885 --> 00:13:27.224
That's not it! It's all my fault!

00:13:29.560 --> 00:13:31.061
I apologize.

00:13:31.061 --> 00:13:33.772
Shirasaki said she wanted to find you,

00:13:33.772 --> 00:13:37.150
so I thought it was because
she wanted to catch the molester...

00:13:37.150 --> 00:13:41.071
No, it's because I wasn't being clear...

00:13:41.071 --> 00:13:46.910
Actually, I just wanted
to say thank you... I'm sorry.

00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:49.413
Well, I'm just glad this
misunderstanding was cleared up.

00:13:49.413 --> 00:13:52.958
But it was all over school on the web news.

00:13:52.958 --> 00:13:55.460
Well, I'm sure it'll work itself out somehow.

00:13:55.460 --> 00:13:59.131
I guess I'll head back to the classroom now.

00:13:59.131 --> 00:14:01.675
It was a long lunch break.

00:14:07.389 --> 00:14:09.600
It didn't work itself out...

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:17.065
You can't run anymore!

00:14:17.065 --> 00:14:20.360
To molest such a cute girl! You're the worst!

00:14:20.360 --> 00:14:23.197
Wait a minute, the molestation
was a misunderstanding!

00:14:23.197 --> 00:14:27.784
Let's ask his body if it was
a misunderstanding or not.

00:14:27.784 --> 00:14:31.538
It doesn't look like anyone
will listen to what I have to say...

00:14:32.247 --> 00:14:35.459
Don't underestimate a
self-made library club member!

00:14:35.459 --> 00:14:38.045
Wait, I have no physical strength...

00:14:45.928 --> 00:14:47.804
Takamine!

00:14:50.140 --> 00:14:54.144
You have some nerve laying a finger on my man!

00:14:54.144 --> 00:14:57.272
No, it's not like that, though.

00:14:57.272 --> 00:14:59.942
Takamine, formerly of the karate club, huh?

00:14:59.942 --> 00:15:02.486
All I could ask for in an opponent!

00:15:02.486 --> 00:15:06.323
I feel like we're getting a
little off topic here, though...

00:15:06.323 --> 00:15:09.535
Maybe things will calm
down if I beg for forgiveness?

00:15:09.535 --> 00:15:11.787
Please, listen!

00:15:11.787 --> 00:15:12.913
Huh?

00:15:12.913 --> 00:15:21.255
K-Kakei isn't a... m-mole... I mean...

00:15:21.255 --> 00:15:22.673
Molester...

00:15:22.673 --> 00:15:23.507
What?

00:15:23.507 --> 00:15:24.383
He's not a molester?

00:15:24.383 --> 00:15:25.425
But what about the picture?

00:15:25.425 --> 00:15:26.593
I can't hear you!

00:15:26.593 --> 00:15:28.053
H-He's not!

00:15:28.053 --> 00:15:31.515
He's not a molester... He's... He's...

00:15:33.600 --> 00:15:35.394
Yes! That's right!

00:15:35.394 --> 00:15:37.896
It wasn't against my will!

00:15:37.896 --> 00:15:39.356
What?

00:15:45.279 --> 00:15:47.489
What? What?

00:15:47.489 --> 00:15:53.495
In the end, things calmed down with people
thinking it was an idiot couple's exhibitionism.

00:15:57.040 --> 00:15:57.541
"Shiomi Academy General Library"

00:15:57.541 --> 00:16:00.127
"Shiomi Academy General Library"
This is my first time at the library club.

00:16:00.127 --> 00:16:03.630
Is this all right? We're not members, you know.

00:16:03.630 --> 00:16:07.217
It doesn't look like there's
anywhere else we can talk quietly.

00:16:07.217 --> 00:16:09.428
I'm the only one that comes here.

00:16:13.515 --> 00:16:15.267
Please excuse the intrusion.

00:16:17.895 --> 00:16:19.771
"Japanese Literature Anthology,  Anthropology, Civil Law"

00:16:22.274 --> 00:16:25.819
Sit anywhere. Just don't mess up the books.

00:16:30.407 --> 00:16:32.242
A-A cat?

00:16:32.242 --> 00:16:36.079
That's Gizaemon. I usually just call him Giza.

00:16:36.079 --> 00:16:37.956
He's so cute!

00:16:40.876 --> 00:16:45.088
What, so we're all in the same class?

00:16:45.088 --> 00:16:48.467
Well, there are over 600 of us,
so it'd be hard to remember everyone.

00:16:48.467 --> 00:16:51.887
Besides, all you do is read.

00:16:51.887 --> 00:16:55.599
Will he think I'm weird
if I say it out of the blue?

00:16:55.599 --> 00:17:00.437
But if I don't say it now,
I probably won't have another chance!

00:17:00.437 --> 00:17:04.191
U-Um... Kakei?

00:17:04.191 --> 00:17:04.816
Yeah?

00:17:04.816 --> 00:17:09.446
W-Won't you make school fun with me?

00:17:09.446 --> 00:17:10.822
"Shiomi Happy Project"
W-Won't you make school fun with me?

00:17:13.534 --> 00:17:14.326
Huh?

00:17:14.326 --> 00:17:15.702
You're inviting him?

00:17:15.702 --> 00:17:16.620
I can't?

00:17:16.620 --> 00:17:19.456
Well, it's not that you can't...

00:17:19.456 --> 00:17:22.459
"Won't you make school fun with me?"

00:17:22.459 --> 00:17:24.878
"Shiomi Happy Project."

00:17:25.838 --> 00:17:30.259
I have a really introverted personality,

00:17:30.259 --> 00:17:33.345
and I wanted to change myself...

00:17:33.345 --> 00:17:37.015
That's why I thought I'd do something big!

00:17:37.015 --> 00:17:40.060
So then, what will you do, specifically?

00:17:40.060 --> 00:17:44.189
That's... not decided yet...

00:17:44.189 --> 00:17:46.900
It's... something I'm still thinking about...

00:17:47.818 --> 00:17:51.572
You couldn't do it by yourself,
so you wanted people to do it with you...

00:17:51.572 --> 00:17:55.075
Um, it doesn't have to be forever...

00:17:55.075 --> 00:17:59.538
I know! It'd be nice if we could
see how it goes until Golden Week!

00:17:59.538 --> 00:18:01.665
A limited time thing, huh?

00:18:01.665 --> 00:18:03.417
Which means I'd have to hang out

00:18:03.417 --> 00:18:07.379
with this kind-of-strange girl,
Tsugumi Shirasaki, until Golden Week, huh?

00:18:07.379 --> 00:18:11.675
I cannot allow Kakei to
participate in those activities.

00:18:11.675 --> 00:18:13.719
The student council president!

00:18:13.719 --> 00:18:18.390
U-Um, what do you mean by "those activities"?

00:18:18.390 --> 00:18:23.896
I mean activities with ambiguous goals,
objectives, and motivation.

00:18:23.896 --> 00:18:26.857
I value Kakei's abilities highly

00:18:26.857 --> 00:18:30.194
and have been asking him to become
a student council officer for a long time.

00:18:30.194 --> 00:18:32.404
A student council officer?!

00:18:33.363 --> 00:18:37.326
If you are going to interpose,
I hope you'll do so after you're more prepared.

00:18:37.326 --> 00:18:39.244
I don't care if you're the
student council president.

00:18:39.244 --> 00:18:41.622
Did you come all the way here to fight us?

00:18:41.622 --> 00:18:45.250
If that's the case, I'll take
you on with all my strength.

00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:50.881
Honestly, I have no interest in the
student council or in Shirasaki's activities.

00:18:50.881 --> 00:18:54.843
I just want Kakei to make the right decision!

00:18:54.843 --> 00:18:59.806
For me, reading is much
more beneficial than those things.

00:19:00.641 --> 00:19:12.694
I... Because I met Kakei today, I experienced
a lot of things I'd never experienced before...

00:19:12.694 --> 00:19:18.283
That's why I feel like if I'm with him,
I can start something new!

00:19:18.283 --> 00:19:20.410
I see!

00:19:20.410 --> 00:19:25.874
Shirasaki must be acting on
something other than emotions or words.

00:19:25.874 --> 00:19:30.420
And that something is beyond
what I can understand right now.

00:19:30.420 --> 00:19:31.296
"Shiomi Happy Project
Won't you make school fun with me?"

00:19:31.296 --> 00:19:35.717
I... want to know this thing I don't understand.

00:19:37.302 --> 00:19:40.514
You said until Golden Week, right?

00:19:40.514 --> 00:19:42.599
Y-Yeah.

00:19:44.393 --> 00:19:46.311
I've decided.

00:19:46.311 --> 00:19:48.438
I'll help you, Shirasaki.

00:19:50.399 --> 00:19:51.733
Kakei!

00:19:51.733 --> 00:19:54.027
Kakei, why?

00:19:54.027 --> 00:19:58.615
Now, now. If you're too pushy,
you won't be able to become friends.

00:19:58.615 --> 00:20:02.494
I didn't say I wanted to be friends with Kakei!

00:20:02.494 --> 00:20:04.621
Who said I was talking about Kakei?

00:20:04.621 --> 00:20:06.748
Thank you, Kakei!

00:20:06.748 --> 00:20:10.377
Thank you! Thank you!

00:20:13.297 --> 00:20:19.761
Kakei. I'll clear up the
misunderstanding on the web news.

00:20:19.761 --> 00:20:21.054
Now we have three, huh?

00:20:21.054 --> 00:20:22.723
Hey, let me join, too.

00:20:22.723 --> 00:20:24.600
Really? Thanks!

00:20:24.600 --> 00:20:27.144
Okay, let's all meet here starting tomorrow!

00:20:27.144 --> 00:20:27.811
What?

00:20:27.811 --> 00:20:31.523
All right, from now on, this will
be the Shiomi Happy Project HQ!

00:20:31.523 --> 00:20:32.649
Yeah!

00:20:32.649 --> 00:20:35.402
Hey, wait! This is a library room!

00:20:35.402 --> 00:20:37.404
Hey Teach, I wanna join the library club!

00:20:37.404 --> 00:20:39.156
I want to join the club, too!

00:20:39.156 --> 00:20:40.282
Hey!

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:44.703
Okay, I'm going to take a picture to celebrate!

00:20:45.204 --> 00:20:46.747
Smile!

00:20:48.207 --> 00:20:52.586
Me, too? What a coincidence.

00:20:52.586 --> 00:20:54.880
Is it a school-wide email from the school?

00:20:56.757 --> 00:21:03.388
"The library club has made a decent start.
Congratulations. The Shepherd."

00:21:03.388 --> 00:21:04.890
I got the same message.

00:21:04.890 --> 00:21:05.516
What?

00:21:05.516 --> 00:21:06.308
You too?

00:21:06.308 --> 00:21:07.518
You too, Sakuraba?

00:21:07.518 --> 00:21:08.644
I did, too!

00:21:08.644 --> 00:21:09.811
What?

00:21:09.811 --> 00:21:12.231
Everyone got the same thing...

00:21:12.231 --> 00:21:14.399
What the heck is this?

00:21:14.399 --> 00:21:16.360
A new kind of spam?

00:21:16.360 --> 00:21:19.321
No matter what it is, it gives me a bad feeling.

00:21:19.321 --> 00:21:23.492
Is there evidence this is the real Shepherd?

00:21:23.492 --> 00:21:27.454
Does the Shepherd even exist?

00:21:30.916 --> 00:21:32.334
You're too noisy.

00:21:33.168 --> 00:21:35.629
I've been hearing your
voices outside for a while now.

00:21:35.629 --> 00:21:38.215
It says "Quiet, please"
all over the place. Can't you read?

00:21:38.215 --> 00:21:40.300
S-Sorry!

00:21:40.300 --> 00:21:46.807
You know, us library staff are the ones who
get glared at to do something by the patrons.

00:21:46.807 --> 00:21:48.725
Sorry, we'll be careful.

00:21:49.810 --> 00:21:51.520
You're Kakei, aren't you?

00:21:51.520 --> 00:21:53.272
Y-Yeah...

00:21:53.272 --> 00:21:56.817
I thought the library club only had
members who never actually came,

00:21:56.817 --> 00:21:59.611
but you're different, huh?

00:22:05.075 --> 00:22:08.245
Is this really okay?

00:22:08.245 --> 00:22:11.456
But I want to know what I don't know.

00:22:11.456 --> 00:22:15.210
If I could just understand this Shirasaki girl,

00:22:15.210 --> 00:22:20.007
it could become a light
to dispel the darkness for me.

00:22:20.966 --> 00:22:23.552
You will understand someday.

00:22:30.809 --> 00:22:33.770
Is he really a Shepherd candidate?

00:22:33.770 --> 00:22:36.440
Yeah, like you.

00:22:36.440 --> 00:22:39.193
He has very high potential.

00:22:39.193 --> 00:22:41.945
You saw the incident this morning, right?

00:22:41.945 --> 00:22:43.822
I've started things off.

00:22:43.822 --> 00:22:47.826
While I'm not around,
you should watch him carefully.

00:22:47.826 --> 00:22:48.660
Yes, sir.

00:22:48.660 --> 00:22:51.538
The day will likely come that
we will reveal the truth to him,

00:22:51.538 --> 00:22:53.874
and have him take the test.

00:22:55.375 --> 00:23:03.091
And then one of you, the one who passes
the test, will become the true Shepherd.

00:23:03.091 --> 00:23:07.304
That guy... He didn't remember at all.

00:23:12.643 --> 00:23:15.812
I'm so glad Kakei is going to
participate in the Happy Project!

00:23:15.812 --> 00:23:18.315
How many times do I have to say this?
It's just until Golden Week.

00:23:18.315 --> 00:23:20.275
Yeah! I'm counting on you till then.

00:23:20.275 --> 00:23:23.111
What do you usually do
in the library club, Kakei?

00:23:23.111 --> 00:23:25.447
Let's see, usually I read...

00:23:25.447 --> 00:23:26.073
Yeah?

00:23:26.073 --> 00:23:27.574
And read...

00:23:27.574 --> 00:23:28.283
Yes, yes?

00:23:28.283 --> 00:23:30.369
And then read, I guess.

00:23:30.369 --> 00:23:32.037
Really?

00:23:32.037 --> 00:23:33.997
"Next Time: Lost and Found"

00:23:33.997 --> 00:23:37.046
"Next Time: Lost and Found"
Public humiliation fetish?
